[{"id":"fastapi-0141-uploadfile-vs-bytes","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["上传","内存"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析","articlePath":"posts/fcf9c728/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析","articlePath":"posts/fcf9c728/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>UploadFile\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>bytes\u003c/code> 上传的内存和调用边界是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>bytes\u003c/code> 直接接收完整内容，简单但会占用载荷大小的内存；\u003ccode>UploadFile\u003c/code> 提供文件元数据和异步读写，更适合较大文件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>两者都要求 multipart 请求，但内存策略不同。小文件可以用 \u003ccode>bytes\u003c/code> 直接校验；大文件应使用 \u003ccode>UploadFile\u003c/code>，按需读取并限制大小。无论选择哪一种，都要检查 \u003ccode>content_type\u003c/code>、文件名和业务大小上限；上传接口不能因为类型标注存在就自动变成安全的文件存储。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-worker-vs-async","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["部署","进程"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十三)部署与生产运维.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十三)部署与生产运维","articlePath":"posts/a584b159/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十三)部署与生产运维.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十三)部署与生产运维","articlePath":"posts/a584b159/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>多 worker 与异步 I/O 分别解决什么问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>异步 I/O 提高单进程等待期间的并发，worker 增加独立进程并行和故障隔离；两者都会增加资源消耗，不能互相替代。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>异步 I/O 让一个事件循环在等待网络/数据库时处理其他协程，但同步阻塞仍会冻结该进程。多 worker 用多个进程利用多核并隔离崩溃，每个进程各有连接池、内存和 lifespan。选择要结合 CPU、I/O、数据库容量和关闭语义，并按 worker 数重新计算连接上限。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-L2-FAQ-001","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["交换机","IP","MAC"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":16,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么普通交换机不能直接根据 IP 转发以太网帧？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>普通二层交换机依据当前链路中的目的 MAC 和 FDB 转发；根据 IP 做三层转发需要路由表、最长前缀匹配和 TTL 等网络层逻辑。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>普通交换机的基本转发输入是以太网帧的目的 MAC，不是 IP；IP 通常只是帧载荷里的更高层字段。交换机先用源 MAC 学习 FDB，再用目的 MAC 查端口；只有具备并启用三层路由能力的设备才会读取目标 IP 并查路由表。访问远端网络时，主机通常把帧交给默认网关的 MAC，而不是直接交给远端服务器的 MAC。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a7-schedule","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["定时任务","环境"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理","articlePath":"posts/23ca1872/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理","articlePath":"posts/23ca1872/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 crontab 中能在交互式 Shell 运行的命令可能失败？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>定时任务的 PATH、工作目录、Shell 和环境变量不同，还可能没有 TTY。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>cron 启动的上下文通常没有交互式 Shell 的环境。可以用接近 cron 的方式做一次对照：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">env\u003c/span> -i HOME=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$HOME\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span> PATH=/usr/bin:/bin \\\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  sh -c \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;printf &quot;cwd=%s PATH=%s tty=%s\\\\n&quot; &quot;$PWD&quot; &quot;$PATH&quot; &quot;$(tty 2&gt;/dev/null || printf none)&quot;&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>脚本应显式设置工作目录、关键环境变量和命令路径，并把标准输出/错误写入可轮转的日志；先以相同用户在非交互环境复现，再把任务交给 cron。能在终端成功只能证明交互上下文成立。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a2-env-printenv","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["环境变量","Shell"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/"}],"articleIndex":6,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>env 与 printenv PATH 的使用场景如何区分？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>env 默认列出环境变量；printenv PATH 只读取一个变量，更适合脚本和证据记录。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>printenv\u003c/code> 只能看到导出的环境变量，而当前 Shell 的普通变量不会自动进入子进程：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">local_only=value\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">export\u003c/span> inherited=value\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">sh -c \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;printf &quot;local=%s inherited=%s\\\\n&quot; &quot;$&#123;local_only-&lt;unset&gt;&#125;&quot; &quot;$inherited&quot;&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>输出中 \u003ccode>local\u003c/code> 通常为空而 \u003ccode>inherited\u003c/code> 有值。\u003ccode>env\u003c/code> 适合一次观察整个继承环境，\u003ccode>printenv PATH\u003c/code> 适合脚本记录单个键；排障报告不要把完整环境原样上传，以免带出令牌或内部地址。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a6-sudo-su","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["sudo","su"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理","articlePath":"posts/5a63b164/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(六)用户权限与软件管理","articlePath":"posts/5a63b164/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>sudo 与 su - 的主要边界是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>sudo 通常授权执行特定命令；su - 切换到另一个用户的登录环境，影响的会话上下文更大。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>sudo\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>su -\u003c/code> 的差异可以从执行上下文看出来：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">sudo\u003c/span> -l                 \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 当前用户被允许执行什么\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">sudo\u003c/span> systemctl status ssh.service\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">su - alice               \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 切换为 alice 的登录环境（会改变 HOME、Shell 等）\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>sudo\u003c/code> 通常把一次命令限制在策略允许的范围内，\u003ccode>su -\u003c/code> 会创建另一个用户的完整登录会话，影响范围更大。两者都不替代授权记录；涉及生产变更时还要保存目标、批准、复测和回滚证据。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a11-trap-cleanup","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["trap","清理"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化","articlePath":"posts/496664b1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化","articlePath":"posts/496664b1/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>脚本如何保证临时文件在中断后清理？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>创建临时目录后注册 EXIT trap；INT/TERM handler 以 130/143 退出，再由 EXIT trap 清理。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>让退出路径只有一个清理出口：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">LAB=$(\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">mktemp\u003c/span> -d)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"function\">\u003cspan class=\"title\">cleanup\u003c/span>\u003c/span>() &#123; \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">rm\u003c/span> -rf -- \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$LAB\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>; &#125;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"function\">\u003cspan class=\"title\">on_signal\u003c/span>\u003c/span>() &#123; \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">trap\u003c/span> - INT TERM; \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">exit\u003c/span> 130; &#125;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">trap\u003c/span> cleanup EXIT\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">trap\u003c/span> on_signal INT TERM\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>EXIT\u003c/code> 会在正常退出、显式 \u003ccode>exit\u003c/code> 和信号 handler 退出后执行；handler 如果只清理而返回，主流程可能继续写入已删除的目录。\u003ccode>mktemp\u003c/code> 生成的目录必须由脚本独占，不能把外部输入直接交给 \u003ccode>rm -rf\u003c/code>，因为 trap 只是清理机制而不是安全边界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a4-sort-uniq","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["排序","聚合"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(四)文本处理与数据提取.md","articleTitle":"Linux(四)文本处理与数据提取","articlePath":"posts/33859692/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(四)文本处理与数据提取.md","articleTitle":"Linux(四)文本处理与数据提取","articlePath":"posts/33859692/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 uniq -c 前通常要先 sort？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>uniq 只合并相邻重复行，sort 才能把相同键放在一起。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>uniq\u003c/code> 只比较相邻行：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> api db api api | \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">uniq\u003c/span> -c\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> api db api api | \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">sort\u003c/span> | \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">uniq\u003c/span> -c\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>第一条会把不相邻的 \u003ccode>api\u003c/code> 分成两组，第二条先排序后才得到完整计数。只有输入协议明确保证已经按同一键分组时才可省略 \u003ccode>sort\u003c/code>，并把这个前提写进脚本或报告，否则“结果看起来合理”也可能漏项。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-event-order","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["浏览器事件","组件"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(六)常见组件操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(六)常见组件操作","articlePath":"posts/8df5b6f3/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(六)常见组件操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(六)常见组件操作","articlePath":"posts/8df5b6f3/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 popup、download 和 file chooser 都要先建立等待再触发动作？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它们是可能瞬间结束的浏览器事件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先触发再监听可能错过事件；\u003ccode>with page.expect_*()\u003c/code> 把监听与触发动作组织成明确的因果范围，并返回对应对象。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>监听器必须先建立，再触发会产生事件的动作：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">with\u003c/span> page.expect_download() \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">as\u003c/span> info:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    page.get_by_role(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;button&quot;\u003c/span>, name=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;导出&quot;\u003c/span>).click()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">download = info.value\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>with 把“等待哪个事件”和“哪一个动作触发它”绑定在同一范围内；先 click 再等待时，瞬时完成的 popup、下载或 file chooser 可能已经错过。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-tmp-path","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["临时资源"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身","articlePath":"posts/1d2bf183/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身","articlePath":"posts/1d2bf183/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>tmp_path 与 tmp_path_factory 的生命周期有何不同？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>tmp_path 通常按 function 提供独立目录；tmp_path_factory 可在更长作用域创建共享目录。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>tmp_path\u003c/code> 是测试函数级的路径 Fixture，每个测试拿到独立目录；\u003ccode>tmp_path_factory\u003c/code> 是创建这些目录的工厂，可以在更长作用域提前生成共享的只读数据。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.fixture(\u003cspan class=\"params\">scope=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;session&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">sample_file\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">tmp_path_factory\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    root = tmp_path_factory.mktemp(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;fixtures&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    path = root / \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;input.json&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    path.write_text(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;&#123;&#125;&quot;\u003c/span>, encoding=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;utf-8&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> path\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_parse\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">tmp_path\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    output = tmp_path / \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;result.json&quot;\u003c/span>  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 本测试独有\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    ...\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>共享缓存必须只读或由明确的锁、命名和清理策略保护；并行测试若写入同一工厂目录，就会把生命周期问题变成数据竞争。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-conftest-visibility","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["Fixture 可见性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(八)配置与套件组织.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(八)配置与套件组织","articlePath":"posts/26397f68/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(八)配置与套件组织.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(八)配置与套件组织","articlePath":"posts/26397f68/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>conftest.py 的 Fixture 为什么在某些目录不可见？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>Fixture 按测试目录向上查找，子目录可以覆盖父级；兄弟目录的 conftest 不会互相可见。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Pytest 从测试所在目录向上寻找 \u003ccode>conftest.py\u003c/code>，不会横向搜索兄弟目录。目录关系可以这样判断：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">tests/conftest.py              ← tests/api/test_user.py 可见\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">tests/api/conftest.py          ← tests/api 及子目录可见\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">tests/web/conftest.py          ← tests/api 不可见\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>把共同 Fixture 放在共同祖先或显式插件里；纯工具函数放到普通模块并正常导入。不要直接 \u003ccode>import conftest\u003c/code>，那会绕开 Pytest 的可见性和插件注册边界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-06-topn-per-group-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["窗口函数","Top N","并列"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数","articlePath":"posts/6d8f8f0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数","articlePath":"posts/6d8f8f0/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>查询每个部门薪资最高的两档薪资，要求并列员工全部保留，SQL 怎么写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WITH\u003c/span> ranked \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> e.\u003cspan class=\"operator\">*\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">DENSE_RANK\u003c/span>() \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">OVER\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">PARTITION\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> department_id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> salary \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">DESC\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> r\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> employees \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> e\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> id, department_id, name, salary\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> ranked\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> r \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&lt;=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> department_id, r, id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>三个排名函数表达的业务含义不同：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>函数\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>并列处理\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>取前两档的结果\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>ROW_NUMBER\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>强行给每行唯一序号\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可能丢掉并列员工\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>RANK\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>并列同名次，后续名次跳号\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可能没有第 2 档\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>DENSE_RANK\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>并列同名次，名次连续\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>正好表示两档薪资\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>题目说“薪资档”就用 \u003ccode>DENSE_RANK\u003c/code>；题目说“严格两行”才用 \u003ccode>ROW_NUMBER\u003c/code>，并明确 \u003ccode>ORDER BY salary DESC, id\u003c/code> 这样的 tie-breaker。排名后再过滤 \u003ccode>r &lt;= 2\u003c/code>，不要先 \u003ccode>LIMIT\u003c/code> 破坏分组。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a11-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["探索式测试","记录"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十一)探索式测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十一)探索式测试","articlePath":"posts/1d4f3128/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十一)探索式测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十一)探索式测试","articlePath":"posts/1d4f3128/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>探索式测试需要写文档吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>需要保留足以复盘的章程、步骤、输入、观察、证据和未决问题，但不要求事先写完所有脚本。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>探索的设计会随学习结果变化，不能用固定用例阻止新问题；如果完全不记录，别人无法复现，发现也无法沉淀为回归。最小记录包括目标和时间盒、版本/环境、路径和数据、实际结果、证据位置、风险与下一步。记录可以轻量，但不能用“凭感觉测过”替代。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>执行练习：对客服聊天页面安排 30 分钟会话，固定构建 \u003ccode>build-12\u003c/code>、账号 \u003ccode>user-a\u003c/code> 和会话 ID \u003ccode>S-1\u003c/code>。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>时间\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>动作\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>必须记录\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>0–5 分钟\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>登录、进入客服、确认入口和队列\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>版本、账号状态、会话 ID\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>5–25 分钟\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>发送空文本、500/501 字符、图片；制造 ACK 丢失并重试；结束后重进\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>输入、消息 ID、状态、双方记录、日志位置\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>25–30 分钟\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>复现异常、整理未覆盖路径和回归候选\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>最小步骤、影响、下一步负责人\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]